      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should focus on identifying guests who seem disruptive, regardless of their background. Pay attention to patterns like excessive noise, late-night disturbances, or guests who seem overly boisterous. Staff should be trained to observe these behaviors discreetly and address them calmly before they escalate into major issues. This proactive approach helps maintain the high-end atmosphere your boutique property is known for.",
